\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 The deductible math is no longer the structural impediment. The April 2026 assessment said: "Even if the family convinces a court that additional windows should have been included, the total damage still needs to exceed $17,720 before Farmers owes a single dollar." The May 2026 assessment identifies three independent paths that each overcome the deductible:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f2\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Path 1
\f0\b0  \'97 Per-window arithmetic on Prieve's 17 documented hail-signature windows at the panel's own ~$6,400/window rate produces ~$108,800 RCV 
\f4 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  ~$54,400 ACV 
\f4 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  ~$36,680 net after deductible.\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Path 2
\f0\b0  \'97 
\f3\i Cedar Bluff
\f0\i0  matching on the full home with Semco out of business easily exceeds the deductible by tens of thousands.\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Path 3
\f0\b0  \'97 Non-window components (5 downspouts, 3 flashing, 2 siding penetrations, 3 trim chips, 1 door window screen) \'97 none subject to the appraisal bar.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
